        {
          "text": "Kwondũ wa ũu, endwa, nĩkwĩthĩwa mweteele maũndũ asu, thangaai kana mwoneke mũuonĩ, mũte na ĩlanga na mũtekwilĩĩlĩka mbee wake. ",
